  "description": "The iconic flavors of Tex-Mex-style taco filling—all piled on top of Japanese short-grain rice. Despite its Tex-Mex appearance, the dish is a signature Okinawan meal that tells a deeper story of how war and the US military have influenced local cuisine.",
